  "summary": "SCKit is a malicious toolkit that abuses legitimate ScreenConnect remote-support software. After initial deployment, it installs an unauthorized secondary client for remote access, establishes persistence via scheduled tasks and Run keys, and deploys the RelayTrap component to deliver payloads to connecting IT support technicians. The toolkit also includes components for stealing browser authentication cookies to hijack web sessions.",
